// @spec: Classes — Error class prohibition
// @description: User-declared class Error is prohibited per v1.1 Error handling / Type system (E4006). The rule originates in Error handling but is placed in classes/ for directory consistency.
// @expected: compile-error E4006
// @features: classes, error-prohibition

// Case 1: module-level class Error
class Error { message: string = ""; }

// Case 2: nested class Error inside a function body
function f(): null { class Error { code: string = ""; } return null; }
